 {
  "date": "2026-08-07",
  "headline": "First human case of West Nile virus reported in Kern County: Public Health",
  "url": "/briefs/2026-08-07/",
  "content": "\n    <article class=\"article-lead brief-read\">\n      <div class=\"greet\"><p><strong>Good morning, Kern County.</strong> \u2014 today&rsquo;s high should land near 105&deg;, a Heat Advisory is in effect, air quality sits at 140. <strong>First human case of West Nile virus reported in Kern County: Public Health</strong> is the big story we&rsquo;re watching today \u2014 full rundown below.</p></div>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-weather\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">Weather</span><h2 id=\"seg-weather\">Today's weather</h2></div>\n        <figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/skyline.jpg\" alt=\"Bakersfield skyline panorama\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"568\"><figcaption>Photo: Bobak Ha'Eri &middot; CC BY 3.0 &middot; <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2008-0621-Bakersfield-pan.JPG\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure>\n        <div class=\"card\"><p>Expect a high near 105\u00b0 and a low around 75\u00b0 tonight.</p><p>It's currently 102\u00b0 at Meadows Field (KBFL).</p><p><strong>Heat Advisory</strong>: Heat Advisory issued August 7 at 2:32PM PDT until August 9 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Hanford CA</p><p>Air quality is 140 \u2014 unhealthy for sensitive groups.</p><p>Fire crews are on 2 active fires in Kern (Cassie Fire, Buzzard Fire).</p></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-news\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">News</span><h2 id=\"seg-news\">Top stories</h2></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><ul class=\"story-list\"><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/local-news/first-human-case-of-west-nile-virus-reported-in-kern-county-public-health/\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Top story:</strong> First human case of West Nile virus reported in Kern County: Public Health \u2014 <em>via KGET 17.</em></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/entertainment-news/comedian-michael-yo-to-headline-the-well-comedy-club-saturday/\" rel=\"noopener\">Comedian Michael Yo to headline The Well Comedy Club Saturday</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/crime-watch/death-penalty-waived-in-shooting-that-killed-woman-outside-bakersfield-restaurant/\" rel=\"noopener\">Death penalty waived in shooting that killed woman outside Bakersfield restaurant</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/local-news/kern-county-public-health-confirms-first-cases-of-measles/\" rel=\"noopener\">Kern County Public Health confirms first cases of measles</a></li></ul><p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Summaries are written from the headline and link to the original outlet for details.</p></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-good\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head good-head\"><h2 id=\"seg-good\">Something good</h2></div>\n        \n        <div class=\"card pos-card\">\n          <img class=\"thumb\" src=\"../../assets/img/fair.jpg\" alt=\"Kern County Fair\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"857\">\n          <div class=\"pos-body\">\n            <span class=\"cat-tag\">Family fun</span>\n            <h3><a href=\"https://www.mechanicsbankarena.com/event/blueys-big-play/145/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Blueys Big Play</a></h3>\n            <p>Mechanics Bank Arena &middot; Fri, Aug 14 \u2014 a good one to put on the calendar.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-events\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">Out</span><h2 id=\"seg-events\">Upcoming \u2014 concerts, comedy &amp; more</h2></div>\n        <figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/amtrak.jpg\" alt=\"Bakersfield Amtrak station\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\"><figcaption>Photo: LHOON &middot; CC BY-SA 2.0 &middot; <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bakersfield_Amtrak_Station.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure>\n        \n    <div class=\"card\"><ul class=\"ev-list\">\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">Sat 8</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://thebakersfieldfox.com/events/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Strangelove: The Depechemode Experience 2026</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Fox Theater</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">Fri 14</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://thebakersfieldfox.com/events/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>PEPPER With CYDEWAYS</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Fox Theater</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">Fri 14</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://www.mechanicsbankarena.com/event/gavin-adcock/147/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Gavin Adcock</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Mechanics Bank Arena</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">Fri 14</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://www.mechanicsbankarena.com/event/brit-floyd/146/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Brit Floyd</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Mechanics Bank Arena</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">Fri 14</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://www.mechanicsbankarena.com/event/blueys-big-play/145/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Blueys Big Play</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Mechanics Bank Arena</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">Fri 14</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://www.mechanicsbankarena.com/event/the-stars-tour-featuring-anne-wilson/148/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>The Stars Tour Featuring Anne Wilson</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Mechanics Bank Arena</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">Fri 14</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://www.mechanicsbankarena.com/event/christmas-with-cece-winans/149/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Christmas With Cece Winans</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Mechanics Bank Arena</span></span></li></ul>\n    <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">From venue listings we watch: Fox Theater,\n    Mechanics Bank Arena, The Well Comedy Club, the Condors, and more. Dates are as\n    the venue published them. See <a href=\"../../events/\">all events</a>.</p></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">This brief is compiled automatically\n      from public records and linked sources \u2014 a factual digest, not opinion.\n      <a href=\"../../letters/\">Write a letter</a> about anything here \u00b7 report an\n      error: <a href=\"mailto:corrections@bakersfieldbrief.com?subject=Correction&body=Page: ../../briefs/\">corrections@bakersfieldbrief.com</a>.</p>\n    </article>\n    <section class=\"block\" style=\"margin-top:34px\">\n      <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">Next</span><h2>Public meetings \u2014 next 7 days</h2></div>\n      <ul class=\"ev-list\">\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">2026-08-10 15:00</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://pub-bakersfield.escribemeetings.com/Meeting.aspx?Id=2ec6ec25-711a-4a4c-b5e5-195ed060c1c7&amp;Agenda=Agenda&amp;lang=English\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Fire Civil Service Commission</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Public meeting</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">2026-08-13 12:00</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://pub-bakersfield.escribemeetings.com/Meeting.aspx?Id=884dbbaa-c067-4548-93db-7d94c8ba9c71&amp;Agenda=Agenda&amp;lang=English\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Housing and Community Development Committee</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Public meeting</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">2026-08-07 12:00</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://pub-bakersfield.escribemeetings.com/Meeting.aspx?Id=4be14327-e8da-4b1d-b514-9b25bc43169f&amp;Agenda=Agenda&amp;lang=English\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Safe and Healthy Neighborhoods Committee</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Public meeting</span></span></li>\n            <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">2026-08-11</span>\n            <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"../../city-hall/county-board/\"><strong>Board of Supervisors</strong></a>\n            <span class=\"ev-venue\">Kern County</span></span></li></ul>\n      <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Meetings from official agendas. See\n      <a href=\"../../city-hall/\">all city &amp; county meetings</a>.</p>\n    </section>"
